<title>USA: Huizenga puts Florida Marlins up for sale.</title>
<headline>Huizenga puts Florida Marlins up for sale.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wayne Huizenga on Thursday said he was putting the Florida Marlins professional baseball team up for sale.</p>
<p>Huizenga, the Florida business magnate who is chairman of Huizenga Holdings, said in a news release issued before a press conference that he had hired a Fort Lauderdale law firm to approach potential buyers and evaluate any offers.</p>
</text>
